    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Full-service creative studio and production company founded 2017 by Andre Bato, an Italian-born creative director and filmmaker working between NYC, Paris and LA (base NYC). Umbrella company: AB FILMS (film/direction) and AB STUDIO (product development). Directed commercial work for Nike, Zegna, Spotify, Pepsi; music videos for Post Malone (Cooped Up, 2022) and Kaytranada (Need It, 2020); editorial/photo creative for Vogue, V Magazine, GQ, NOWNESS, SHOWSTUDIO; agency relationships with Conde Nast, M&C Saatchi, VICE. Senior, founder/CD-level, 15+ yrs since 2008; Autonomy 5. Type Studio (creative + production house, hands-on execution, founder-led; small core team plus freelancers, Size 2-10 hedged). Work Status Studio (his own company). Sources: 100k.studio profile, IMDb, LinkedIn (the .com /info path is 404; canonical site is andre-bato.com). IG context shot blocked by headless rate-limit; @andrebato queued to ig-queue.json for logged-in ig.py grab. Email: checked andre-bato.com contact page (404), Directors Library listing, and web search; no public booking or contact email found.",
